<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, I want Your best.</l><l>I want Your full blessing.</l><l>I don’t want any less,</l><l>Though good it be.</l><l>Have mercy, Lord, to push, to pull, lay hold of me.</l><l>Keep me still running toward the prize.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Mold me, shape me, Lord.</l><l>Be my reality.</l><l>Even break my heart,</l><l>If it has to be.</l><l>I’m desperate, Lord, that You would have Your way with me.</l><l>Others could touch You then through me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Set my heart aflame.</l><l>Don’t let me stay the same.</l><l>Don’t let things remain</l><l>Which now grieve You.</l><l>My life I give to You and all I’ve claimed as mine.</l><l>May I just hold, Lord, unto You.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
